{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A real-time strategy tower defense game set in a dangerous yet resource-rich forest. Build your base, shape your defenses, and fend off relentless enemy swarms in a battle for survival and supremacy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gather and Grow:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Harvest gold, wood and stone from the forest to expand your base, unlock upgrades, and build advanced tech structures. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RTS Meets Tower Defense:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Experience the strategy of a classic RTS without unit micro-management. Focus entirely on defending against massive waves of enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Campaign and Creativity:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Dive into a challenging campaign or use the built-in map editor to design and share your own custom scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Greed Forest is about mastering the balance between resource management, strategic planning, and creative defense.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3137410?t=1741290879","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3137410?t=1741290879","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137410/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741290879","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137410/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741290879","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A real-time strategy tower defense game set in a dangerous yet resource-rich forest. Build your base, shape your defenses, and fend off relentless enemy swarms in a battle for survival and supremacy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gather and Grow:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Harvest gold, wood and stone from the forest to expand your base, unlock upgrades, and 